                <pb facs="0079" n="59" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v02/pg59"/>

                <head>34. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On January 26, 1962, Deputy Under Secretary of State Johnson sent a letter to
                    Deputy Secretary of Defense Gilpatric agreeing to an increase to 200,000 men in
                    the Vietnamese Armed Forces. For text of this letter, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">United States-Vietnam Relations, 1945-1967</hi>, Book
                    12, pages 445-446.</p>
            </div>
